  "job_B23.3.6.1_20251003_114606": {
    "text": "\u00d0\u00e6re \u00e6resten nyhte, \u00feonne niwe mone by\u00f0 ecymen, \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00feonne in sweofne gesih\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t cyme\u00f0 to\n\u00de\u00e6re \u00e6fteran niht & \u00feore \u00f0riddan nyht, ne byo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t na\u00f0er ne god ne yfel.\n\u00d0\u00e6re feor\u00f0an nyht & \u00feeora fiftan wene heo godre gefremednesse.\n\u00de\u00e6re syxtan niht, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu gesyxt, swa hyt byo\u00f0, & \u00feeo wy\u00f0 eorfo\u00feu geoscilt.\n\u00deere seofo\u00f0an nyht, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu gesixt, swa hyt by\u00f0, & \u00e6fter mycelre tyde ag\u00e6\u00f0.\n\u00de\u00e6re VIII niht & \u00feere nigo\u00fean, ra\u00fee \u00feu gesihst swefn, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 adle o\u00f0\u00fee trega.\n\u00deere nigo\u00f0an niht \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feeo gemete\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t bio\u00f0 butan festnesse.\n\u00deeore XII niht & \u00feeore XIII niht ine \u00ferim dagum \u00feu gesihst \u00fein swefn.\n\u00deeore XIIII nihti ne hafa\u00f0 \u00feat nane gefremednesse.\n\u00deeore XV niht hit hafa\u00f0 litle gefrem\u00e6dnesse.\n\u00deeore XVI niht \u00e6fter mycelre tide ag\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fein sweofn.\n\u00d0ere XVII niht & XVIII & nigontene in III & C um daga bi\u00f0 god swefn.\n\u00d0onne se mona bi\u00f0 XX niht & I & XX niht, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 scir o\u00f0\u00fee ceap in \u00feem swefne toweard.\n\u00deonne heo by\u00f0 II & XX niht eald, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu gesihst, hit lenge\u00f0 to gode gefean.\n\u00deonne heo bi\u00f0 III & XX nihta eald, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 cid & geflit.\n\u00d0onne heo bi\u00f0 IIII & XX nihta eald, & V & XX & VI & XX nihta eald, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 weor\u00f0lic ege, on nigon\n\u00deonne heo bid VII & XX & VIII & XX nihta eald, ealne gefean \u00fe\u00e6t bicne\u00f0.\n\u00deonne heo bi\u00f0 IX & XX & fulle xxx nihta eald, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 \u00e6fre buton fr\u00e6cnesse.",
